## 3. Implementation Plan

### 3.1 Change Management Process

The change management process will follow the ADKAR model (Awareness, Desire, Knowledge, Ability, Reinforcement).

| Phase     | Description                                                                 | Responsible Party            | Timeline         |
|-----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------|------------------|
| Awareness | Communicate the need for change to all employees through meetings.          | John Anderson (CEO)          | October 2023     |
| Desire    | Create desire for change through workshops and meetings.                    | Lisa Roberts (HR Manager)    | November 2023    |
| Knowledge | Provide training on agile methodologies and project management tools.       | Sarah Thompson (Project Mgr) | December 2023    |
| Ability   | Implement agile practices and new software.                                 | Michael Chen (CTO)           | January 2024     |
| Reinforcement | Regularly review progress and adjust strategies as needed.              | John Anderson (CEO)          | Ongoing          |

### 3.2 Key Milestones

